        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>核心知识点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· open() 与三种模式</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.1 为什么需要文件：变量活不过程序结束</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 变量 = 草稿纸上的字——写完一扔就没了。</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 文件 = 写在笔记本上的字——合上本子，明天还在。</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.2 open() 与三种模式</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· w 模式的陷阱必须重点记住：它不是"写进文件"，而是"</text><text x='486' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>把文件清空，然后从零开始写"。如果你只是想往文件…</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.3 with open(...)：不只是语法糖</text><text x='890' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· with 做了两件普通写法做不到的事：</text><text x='890' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ① 自动关闭文件，而且保证一定会关。</text><text x='890' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ② 出块后 f 变量本身失效。</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
            <text x='64' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Python 讲授课件 · 逐节版</text>
